      <strong>Cybersecurity Tester – Staff</strong> at Dekra Testing & Certification  
      <em>(March 2025 – Present · Málaga)</em>
      <ul>
        <li>Responsible for executing security testing and assessment activities within LINCE, Common Criteria (CC), and other cybersecurity certification schemes.</li>
        <li>Performed penetration testing and robustness testing on critical services, focusing on vulnerability identification and error-handling validation.</li>
        <li>Collaborated with development and certification teams to define test scenarios and produce technical reports.</li>
      </ul>
    </li>

