        <li>Supported risk assessments, remediation planning, and overall project risk-management strategy.</li>
        <li>Collaborated with multidisciplinary teams to maintain the integrity, confidentiality, and availability of critical banking infrastructure.</li>
      </ul>
    </li>

    {/* EY – Internship */}
    <li>
      <strong>Cybersecurity Intern</strong> at EY GDS Spain  
      <em>(April 2024 – September 2024 · Málaga)</em>
      <ul>
